`supabase_vault 0.3.1`, `pgcrypto`, `pg_cron`; `unaccent` and `pg_trgm` are available but not installed. 
`meeting_notes` and `meeting_note_action_items` have 0 rows locally and one SELECT policy each 
(`*_select_same_company`, joining through `spaces`); authenticated has SELECT only (baseline `20260610183139`).

