 108: ## T9 — Usage accounting, processing tickets, and idempotency
 109: Reasoning: Cost protection must hold under concurrency, retries, crashes, and cancellation before any provider 
call exists.
 110: Task: Server-only usage records per company per day (America/Sao_Paulo) with atomic reservation against the 
limit; signed processing tickets (issue time, user, company, note, source revision, transcript identity, settings 
revision; HMAC with a server-only secret; valid 24 h); idempotency keys scoped to user+company+operation and bound to 
that payload; operation records without content kept 30 days (pg_cron cleanup); an operation without outcome 10 
